// fightcave_monsters.rs2: set once TzTok-Jad has called his healers.
//
// An NPC var rather than a player one, and that is the whole reason it exists here: writing a
// PLAYER var needs the protected active player, and an ai_applayer2 trigger does not have one -
// it has the target, unprotected. The Nechryarch's %superior_summon_clock is the same shape for
// the same reason.
[fightcave_jad_called]
type=int
